#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/core.md:816
msgid ""
"`options` supports the same per-call fields as `ptool.run(options)` except "
"that `cmd` and `args` are replaced by the positional `stages` table."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/core.md:818
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/core.md:818"
msgid ""
"The default `echo`, `check`, `confirm`, and `retry` values still come from "
"`ptool.config({ run = { ... } })`."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/core.md:820
msgid "`stdin` is connected to the first stage."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/core.md:821
